OL,3,AUS voters go to polls to decide who
OL,4,Awill control Congress for rest of
OL,5,ATrump's term
OL,6,
OL,7,FVoters are casting their ballots across
OL,8,Fthe US to determine who will control
OL,9,FCongress for the rest of Donald Trump's
OL,10,Fpresidency - here's the latest
OL,12,FAll polls are now open in the midterm
OL,13,Felections, with results due to start
OL,14,Fcoming in from 18:00 ET / 23:00 GMT
OL,16,FTrump's Republican Party currently
OL,17,Fcontrols Congress' two chambers - the
OL,18,FHouse and the Senate - but Democrats
OL,19,Fare hoping to flip enough seats to win
OL,20,Fa majority in both
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
