OL,3,AUS voters go to polls to decide who
OL,4,Awill control Congress for rest of
OL,5,ATrump's term
OL,6,
OL,7,FIf they control Congress, Democrats
OL,8,Fwould be better placed to block Trump's
OL,9,Fplans, and could also launch
OL,10,Finvestigations into the president's
OL,11,Fadministration
OL,13,FIn both Iowa and Ohio, where Senate
OL,14,Fraces are being closely watched, voters
OL,15,Fspeak to the BBC: Marilyn says she
OL,16,F"would not vote for a Democrat" while
OL,17,FTim says the "farm economy" is
OL,18,F"impacting my decision"
